# The service stops while HEALTH waits for the first of two commands: that one is killed (code 128), the wait for
# the other is not started and its entry keeps the in-progress mark. When the service runs again the other is
# waited for, to its deadline of three slices.
database real
auto-wait 0
timeout 3
rules tests/corpus/notify/two.conf
exec * * hang
chart loop.n loop.n_name loop.notify disks things 1
var loop.n v 10
clock 0
pass 0
wait
var loop.n v 70
clock 1
pass 1
running-for 2
clock 2
wait
running 1
clock 3
wait
clock 4
pass 4
